nuggi moringa pterygosperma kalnuggi germplasm drumstick hallucinogenic bhangi indica anabe agaricus loyisara mangarasa arabs verses poisonous geru semecarpus anacardium obviating ishtalinga amulet veerashaivism visha mungari mungari crinum defixum plains poisonous customary barbers gregarious symbolized profuse hairs saloons styptic agulating saloon plains historians opine barbers cereals millet bamboo edible diversities phyllanthus embelica phyllanthus amarus eclipta diversities diversities opine grewia indigofera circinella solanum incanum antivenins diversities sogade hemidesmus indicus viper rvif antagonized viper coagulant hyaluronidase wsg withania somnifera hyaluronidase viper daboia russelii zymogram zoological zoological reptiles amphibians herbivorous carnivorous arthropod scorpions caterpillar leech camels rabidity ophiophagus mythological mystic serpents kraits vipers lycodon aulicus ptyas mucosus crocodile verses scorpions arthropods scorpions scorpions scorpions fauna menace sushrutha samhitha ashtanaga samgraha verses creatures jangama visha vrika shardoola lion mighty mystic elephant gomayu mighty yak fauna kacchapa tortoise shimshumara gangetic dolphin makara crocodile avians lavaka paravata pigeon makshika kshudra pipilika stanzas tiger panthera tigris mantra spelt tiger vyaghra mukha sthambhana mantra tiger spell ethology taming elephant tiger medieval nonviolent spirits nurtured mesmerizing cruel charms prevailed ancestors cruel creatures harming elaborates hypnotizing charms sloth melursus ursinus boar scrofa cristatus prevailed boar strayed mudigere chikmagalur dist canidae thola canis pallipus seelnayi cuon alpinus rabid canis familiaris nari canis indicus felis catus hebbala bekku chaus civet viverricula indica munguri mongoose halogale parvula nakula apes colloquial vanara radiata musu hanuman langoor semnopithecus singaleeka lion silenus elephant camel donkey doddina mriga antilope cervicapra kadavu sambar stag cervus unicolor hulle sarang